<para id="RM0000005L900QX" category="C" type-id="300BL" name-id="5229D-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B1443/43</dtccode>
<dtcname>Mode damper operation malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000005L900QX_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BYW00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The mode damper servo sends the damper position to the air conditioner amplifier assembly by pulse signals. Based on this signal, the air conditioner amplifier assembly rotates the motor (forward, reverse) and moves the mode damper to the desired position. This performs switching control of the air outlets.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1443/43</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When mode damper servo is operating</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Damper servo drive request signal is output, but servo position information does not change or is abnormal</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>30 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Mode damper servo</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Air conditioner harness assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Air Conditioner Amplifier Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
