</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000005L900QX_07" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BYY00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>This diagnostic trouble code is also output if the damper link or damper is locked. Before performing the inspection, confirm that there are no mechanical malfunctions.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
